{"step_index":95,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-25T09:19:58Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-25T09:19:58Z\nCompleted At: 2026-10-25T09:19:58Z\nShowing lines 1-137 of 137\n1: # SYS_08 — نظام تعددية الآراء وتوثيق السياق (Opinion Pluralism & Context Evaluation System)\n2: \n3: ```yaml\n4: ---\n5: system_id: SYS_08\n6: title: نظام تقييم الآرا�